WEBVTT

00:35:57.360 --> 00:36:00.107
It makes sense to be thoughtful
about which ones you share

00:36:00.131 --> 00:36:02.506
and when, where and how you express them.

00:36:02.530 --> 00:36:06.178
After all, you want to be authentic,
but you also want to be professional,

00:36:06.202 --> 00:36:08.536
to set smart boundaries, show empathy

00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:10.253
and not just challenge norms,

00:36:10.277 --> 00:36:12.783
but earn the license to change them.

00:36:12.807 --> 00:36:15.322
You don't have to bring
your whole self to work.

00:36:15.346 --> 00:36:16.813
I think effective authenticity

00:36:16.837 --> 00:36:19.866
is more about bringing
your best selves to work,

00:36:19.890 --> 00:36:22.698
the ones that bring out
the best in others, too.

00:36:22.722 --> 00:36:25.402
(WorkLife theme music)

00:36:29.270 --> 00:36:31.116
Next time on WorkLife.